# Kuro core library. All routines here are ordinary Kuro Actions.

Action KuroIdentity Value;
    Return Value;
Done.

Action KuroMax Left, Right;
    If Left is greater than Right;
        Return Left;
    Else;
        Return Right;
    Done.
Done.

Action KuroMin Left, Right;
    If Left is less than Right;
        Return Left;
    Else;
        Return Right;
    Done.
Done.
